From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Telesphoreo <me@telesphoreo.me>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 00:52:54 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Bound NBT string visitors

Use a shared 1024-element and 64-level budget for attacker-facing diagnostic, macro, and component rendering while keeping default SNBT visitors lossless for durable serialization. Produce valid truncated SNBT and rate-limit truncation logging.

